@801000 = ~My friends! The mountain shook and we saw a great spirit rise from it, just as happened to Wylfdene in the Mead Hall. Does this mean you were successful?~ // HJOLLDER
@801001 = ~Yes. The dragon Icasaracht is no more. Hopefully for good, this time.~ // Charname
@801002 = ~Seems like that dragon has nine lives. But this one, at least, is over. Or maybe we killed her twice? It's hard to tell.~ // Charname
@801003 = ~That is very good news. No the corruption of my people will cease. I think you on behalf of our tribes. I will let them know that some southerners have strong hearts. And now, I will return you to your southern town. Goodbye friends.~ // HJOLLDER
